Covee: present the sign-in pages as Covee

Headscale shows two pages during a device sign-in: the confirmation and the
result. Covee replaces the Headscale logo and favicon with the Covee mark
(scripts/make_brand.swift), loads no web fonts from Google, says "device" and
"network" instead of "node" and "tailnet", drops the links to Headscale and
Tailscale documentation, and matches the broker's page style. No behaviour
changes; the affected template tests follow the new wording.

